n progress</span></div><ul class=\"bd-items\"><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-314</span><span>iOS·Android metrics summary card</span><span class=\"who\">· mobile</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge \"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">○</span>Next</span></div><ul class=\"bd-items\"><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-162</span><span>Apply design system v1 on Android</span><span class=\"who\">· mobile</span></li><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-339</span><span>Show diagrams·cards as pictures</span><span class=\"who\">· mobile</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge wait\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">◆</span>Your turn</span></div><p class=\"bd-none\">None</p></div></section><section class=\"bd-proj\"><div class=\"bd-ph\"><h3 class=\"bd-pn\">equipe-design</h3><span class=\"bd-counts\">1 in progress · 1 next · 1 your turn</span></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge work\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">●</span>In progress</span></div><ul class=\"bd-items\"><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-298</span><span>Accuracy evaluation harness</span><span class=\"who\">· qa</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge \"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">○</span>Next</span></div><ul class=\"bd-items\"><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-307</span><span>Library publish command + monthly re-extract</span><span class=\"who\">· backend</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge wait\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">◆</span>Your turn</span></div><ul class=\"bd-items\"><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-297</span><span>Figma variables plugin</span><span class=\"who\">· frontend</span><span class=\"bd-note\">Needs a Figma sign-in and the plugin imported</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"bd-proj\"><div class=\"bd-ph\"><h3 class=\"bd-pn\">equipe-site</h3><span class=\"bd-counts\">0 in progress · 1 next · 1 your turn</span></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge work\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">●</span>In progress</span></div><p class=\"bd-none\">None</p></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge \"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">○</span>Next</span></div><ul class=\"bd-items\"><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-320</span><span>Anonymous visitor ID + EU·UK consent banner</span><span class=\"who\">· frontend</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bd-row\"><div><span class=\"badge wait\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">◆</span>Your turn</span></div><ul class=\"bd-items\"><li class=\"bd-item\"><span class=\"mono\">T-317</span><span>Auto deploy + per-PR previews</span><span class=\"who\">· frontend</span><span class=\"bd-note\">Needs a Vercel sign-in and the GitHub repository linked</span></li></ul></div></section><p class=\"vc-foot\">As of Nov 3 · equipe board</p> 두 안을 비교하면 이래요. <div class=\"vc-head\"><h2 class=\"vc-title\">Pictures in the conversation: which way to show them</h2><p class=\"vc-meta\">T-335&#39;s three contract candidates</p></div><div class=\"cp\" role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Pictures in the conversation: which way to show them\"><div class=\"cp-r cp-h\" style=\"--n:3\"><div class=\"cp-c k\"></div><div class=\"cp-c\">Mermaid only</div><div class=\"cp-c pick\">HTML card → PNG<span class=\"badge accent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>Recommended</span></div><div class=\"cp-c\">SVG drawn directly</div></div><div class=\"cp-r\" style=\"--n:3\"><div class=\"cp-c k\">Shows on a phone</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">Mermaid only</span>Must become a PNG</div><div class=\"cp-c pick\"><span class=\"lab\">HTML card → PNG ★ Recommended</span>A PNG, shows as is</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">SVG drawn directly</span>The app must draw SVG</div></div><div class=\"cp-r\" style=\"--n:3\"><div class=\"cp-c k\">Looks like the screen</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">Mermaid only</span>Matched by a theme</div><div class=\"cp-c pick\"><span class=\"lab\">HTML card → PNG ★ Recommended</span>Uses the tokens as they are</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">SVG drawn directly</span>The member picks colours</div></div><div class=\"cp-r\" style=\"--n:3\"><div class=\"cp-c k\">What the member fills in</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">Mermaid only</span>A few lines of text</div><div class=\"cp-c pick\"><span class=\"lab\">HTML card → PNG ★ Recommended</span>Only data JSON</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">SVG drawn directly</span>Coordinates and all</div></div><div class=\"cp-r\" style=\"--n:3\"><div class=\"cp-c k\">Safety</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">Mermaid only</span>No scripts</div><div class=\"cp-c pick\"><span class=\"lab\">HTML card → PNG ★ Recommended</span>Scripts·network blocked</div><div class=\"cp-c\"><span class=\"lab\">SVG drawn directly</span>No scripts</div></div></div><p class=\"cp-why\"><b>HTML card → PNG recommended</b> · Mermaid can&#39;t draw tables and number summaries, and when the member fills in only data it comes out as the tokens say, never out of step with the screen.</p><p class=\"vc-foot\">As of Nov 3</p> 끝나면 다시 알려 드릴게요."
